    "description": "Bright SaaS launch-video look: rounded UI cards with crisp canvas-drawn interfaces float at different depths over a soft colour-blob gradient, with large soft drop shadows from a top-left key, frosted-glass panels, depth of field on the hero card, connector lines with travelling chips, a cursor, and springy fly-in / fan / stack / focus choreography.",
